1
00:00:01,501 --> 00:00:02,736
    - PREVIOUSLY ON <i>HAVEN...</i>

2
00:00:02,802 --> 00:00:04,170
    - YOU'VE BEEN FALSIFYING
         POLICE REPORTS.

3
00:00:04,237 --> 00:00:07,073
     - I'VE BEEN DOING WHAT
   WE'VE ALWAYS DONE IN HAVEN.

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,875
    - WE'RE GONNA BE LOOKING
  FOR A NEW CHIEF IMMEDIATELY.

5
00:00:08,942 --> 00:00:11,745
     - SOMEONE WANTS ME OUT?
     IT'S THE REV, ISN'T IT?

6
00:00:11,811 --> 00:00:13,413
     - HE WANTS TO BE CHIEF?

7
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,415
      - HE WANTS TO CONTROL
           WHOEVER IS.

8
00:00:15,482 --> 00:00:17,250
       - YOU ARE AMAZING.

9
00:00:17,317 --> 00:00:19,719
       I WANT YOU, AUDREY,
       BECAUSE YOU'RE YOU.

10
00:00:19,786 --> 00:00:21,921
         - THIS IS EVI.
       - I'M DUKE'S WIFE.

11
00:00:21,988 --> 00:00:23,823
     WHY ARE YOU EVEN HERE?
         - IT'S MY DAD.

12
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:26,059
         THE OLD BASTARD
          MADE ME SWEAR

13
00:00:26,126 --> 00:00:27,927
   THAT I WOULD COME BACK HERE
 IF THE TROUBLES EVER RETURNED.

14
00:00:27,994 --> 00:00:30,063
        AND THEN HE DIED.

15
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:32,465
- DUKE DOESN'T SUSPECT ANYTHING?
              - NO.

16
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:35,101
      AND NOW THAT HE KNOWS
    HIS FATHER WAS MURDERED,

17
00:00:35,168 --> 00:00:36,469
         YOU'VE GOT HIM.

18
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:38,471
          - [chuckles]

19
00:00:46,713 --> 00:00:49,516
          - HI, CATHY.
  HOW'S YOUR LITTLE MAN TODAY?

20
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:55,388
     GOOD TO SEE YA, MARTHA.

21
00:01:03,496 --> 00:01:04,831
      - NOT THE FIRST TIME

22
00:01:04,898 --> 00:01:08,468
        WE'VE CAUGHT YOU
 BREAKING AND ENTERING, DWIGHT.

23
00:01:08,535 --> 00:01:10,770
          - CAUGHT ME?

24
00:01:10,837 --> 00:01:12,806
          CHIEF WUORNOS
       CAN CLEAR THIS UP.

25
00:01:12,872 --> 00:01:15,475
      - YOU HAVEN'T HEARD.

26
00:01:15,542 --> 00:01:18,478
  WUORNOS ISN'T CHIEF ANYMORE.
        WE GOT A NEW GUY.

27
00:01:18,545 --> 00:01:21,147
           SO NO MORE
    SPECIAL TREATMENT FOR...

28
00:01:21,214 --> 00:01:23,750
         SPECIAL PEOPLE,
            YOU KNOW?

29
00:01:24,751 --> 00:01:26,086
       - ARE YOU SWEATIN'?

30
00:01:26,152 --> 00:01:29,155
      - IT'S WARM OUT HERE.
     - I WOULDN'T SAY THAT.

31
00:01:30,190 --> 00:01:33,293
            - DWIGHT.

32
00:01:33,359 --> 00:01:35,328
          WHAT'S THIS?

33
00:01:35,395 --> 00:01:38,164
    - DID A LITTLE CLEANUP AT
 THE CENTRAL COAST MEAT PACKING.

34
00:01:39,332 --> 00:01:40,767
       - WITH A CROSSBOW?

35
00:01:42,368 --> 00:01:44,537
           I GOT THIS
         FROM NOW, PAUL.

36
00:01:46,706 --> 00:01:48,141
             - FINE.

37
00:01:48,208 --> 00:01:50,009
             - PAUL.

38
00:01:51,377 --> 00:01:53,346
             CUFFS.

39
00:02:04,224 --> 00:02:05,992
    - SO THERE'S A NEW CHIEF?

40
00:02:06,059 --> 00:02:08,628
      - YEAH. THE SELECTMAN
    SENT IN THIS GUY MERRILL.

41
00:02:08,695 --> 00:02:10,296
         HE'S A REFORMER
         FROM BRUNSWICK,

42
00:02:10,363 --> 00:02:12,432
    AND I THINK HE'S CLUELESS
       ABOUT THE TROUBLES.

43
00:02:12,499 --> 00:02:13,600
      - WON'T BE FOR LONG.

44
00:02:13,666 --> 00:02:15,502
          - SPRINKLES?

45
00:02:15,568 --> 00:02:17,837
           - OH, YEAH.

46
00:02:17,904 --> 00:02:20,273
          - JUST WATCH
   WHERE YOU POINT THIS THING.

47
00:02:41,161 --> 00:02:43,830
       - WHAT DID I CATCH
         IN THAT PLACE?

48
00:02:49,536 --> 00:02:51,871
         WHAT THE HELL?

49
00:02:53,206 --> 00:02:54,641
             [thud]

50
00:03:16,729 --> 00:03:18,064
          - ALL RIGHT,
         SO YOU'RE OKAY

51
00:03:18,131 --> 00:03:20,300
           WITH TAKING
  THE GRAVEYARD SHIFT TONIGHT?

52
00:03:20,366 --> 00:03:24,337
  - MM-HMM. IT'S GONNA BE GOOD.
       I'M NOT IN CHARGE.

53
00:03:24,404 --> 00:03:27,840
     AND MOST OF HAVEN'S UP
   AT THE BOAT PARADE, SO GO.

54
00:03:27,907 --> 00:03:29,876
          GO ON YOUR--
           YOUR DATE.

55
00:03:29,943 --> 00:03:31,578
       - IT'S NOT A DATE.
           - OH, SURE.

56
00:03:31,644 --> 00:03:33,513
      OF COURSE. THAT'S WHY
 I'VE NEVER SEEN YOU SO NERVOUS.

57
00:03:33,580 --> 00:03:35,181
    BECAUSE OF YOUR NON-DATE.

58
00:03:35,248 --> 00:03:36,849
    - IT'S JUST--IT'S BEEN--

59
00:03:36,916 --> 00:03:39,686
    IT'S BEEN, WHAT, A MONTH
  SINCE CHRIS LEFT FOR LONDON,

60
00:03:39,752 --> 00:03:43,323
   AND HIS TROUBLE WAS STILL,
    YOU KNOW, RELATIVELY NEW.

61
00:03:43,389 --> 00:03:44,657
            - RIGHT,
      AND PEOPLE SEE CHRIS

62
00:03:44,724 --> 00:03:47,493
        AND THEN THEY'RE
       IMMEDIATELY VERY...

63
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,995
          FOND OF HIM.

64
00:03:49,062 --> 00:03:51,564
          IT'S NOTHING
         TO WORRY ABOUT.

65
00:03:51,631 --> 00:03:54,000
              - NO?
              - NO.

66
00:03:54,067 --> 00:03:55,168
          - [chuckles]
               NO.

67
00:03:55,235 --> 00:03:56,836
         - GOT A VISITOR
         UP FRONT, HON'.

68
00:03:56,903 --> 00:04:00,173
            - THANKS.
  - FOR NATHAN. CROCKER'S HERE.

69
00:04:08,948 --> 00:04:11,017
     - YOU KNOW THAT I HATE
    THAT YOU'RE A COP, RIGHT?

70
00:04:11,084 --> 00:04:13,019
             - YEAH.
             - YEAH.

71
00:04:13,086 --> 00:04:14,887
        AND THAT I THINK
         IT'S RIDICULOUS

72
00:04:14,954 --> 00:04:16,689
        THAT THEY PUT YOU
    IN CHARGE OF THIS PLACE.

73
00:04:16,756 --> 00:04:18,391
            - UH-HUH.

74
00:04:18,458 --> 00:04:21,394
  - BUT FOR CERTAIN REASONS...

75
00:04:21,461 --> 00:04:22,795
         IT MAKES SENSE.

76
00:04:22,862 --> 00:04:25,932
    - WELL, I'M NOT THE CHIEF
     ANYMORE, YOU REMEMBER?

77
00:04:25,999 --> 00:04:27,634
             - YEAH.

78
00:04:31,170 --> 00:04:35,275
    BUT DO YOU WANNA KNOW WHY
  YOU'RE NOT THE CHIEF ANYMORE?

79
00:04:35,341 --> 00:04:37,410
              EVI.

80
00:04:37,477 --> 00:04:39,279
     SHE TIPPED OFF THE REV
         ABOUT YOUR FILE

81
00:04:39,345 --> 00:04:41,447
     ON THE TROUBLED PEOPLE.

82
00:04:41,514 --> 00:04:44,017
            I SAW IT
          ON HER PHONE.

83
00:04:45,318 --> 00:04:48,121
            - I KNEW
         IT WAS THE REV.

84
00:04:48,187 --> 00:04:50,623
        BUT HOW THE HELL
        IS EVI INVOLVED?

85
00:04:50,690 --> 00:04:53,459
          - YOU GOT ME.
    I MEAN, THINK HOW I FEEL.

86
00:04:53,526 --> 00:04:54,961
       I'M MARRIED TO HER.

87
00:04:55,028 --> 00:04:57,530
    GOD ONLY KNOWS WHAT ELSE
          SHE'S HIDING.

88
00:04:59,999 --> 00:05:01,768
             LOOK...

89
00:05:01,834 --> 00:05:05,972
    I FIGURE WE DO THIS HERE.
      OTHERWISE SHE'D BOLT.

90
00:05:06,039 --> 00:05:08,141
           I TOLD HER
    THAT YOU WERE HELPING ME

91
00:05:08,207 --> 00:05:10,476
    WITH MY PARKING TICKETS.

92
00:05:10,543 --> 00:05:12,111
         IT WAS THE BEST
      I COULD COME UP WITH.

93
00:05:12,178 --> 00:05:14,314
          - HMM. OKAY.

94
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:16,716
          LET'S PUT HER
       IN THE BREAK ROOM.

95
00:05:19,352 --> 00:05:20,887
             - UM...

96
00:05:23,356 --> 00:05:25,525
     WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?

97
00:05:28,928 --> 00:05:32,965
     - DID DUKE FINALLY PAY
      HIS PARKING TICKETS?

98
00:05:34,033 --> 00:05:35,535
            MM. OH...

99
00:05:36,903 --> 00:05:38,604
             CHRIS.

100
00:05:38,671 --> 00:05:41,441
          - OH, RIGHT.
           WORKPLACE.

101
00:05:41,507 --> 00:05:42,742
             - YEAH.

102
00:05:46,245 --> 00:05:49,182
            - I GUESS
       I JUST DON'T CARE.

103
00:05:49,248 --> 00:05:51,384
     - OKAY, HEY, HEY, HEY.
             - WHAT?

104
00:05:51,451 --> 00:05:53,019
          - WHY DON'T I
       JUST GRAB MY STUFF,

105
00:05:53,086 --> 00:05:56,723
       AND THEN WE CAN GO
         TO THE PARADE?

106
00:05:56,789 --> 00:05:59,058
            - PARADE?

107
00:05:59,125 --> 00:06:00,893
     WITH BOATS, AND LIGHTS,

108
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,628
    AND DRINKING, AND PEOPLE?

109
00:06:02,695 --> 00:06:04,430
             - YEAH.
              - NO.

110
00:06:04,497 --> 00:06:07,367
        I DON'T WANNA SEE
         ANYONE BUT YOU.

111
00:06:07,433 --> 00:06:10,570
     - PARKER, YOU'D BETTER
          GET OUT HERE.

112
00:06:10,636 --> 00:06:11,904
          - I GOTTA...

113
00:06:11,971 --> 00:06:13,573
            - NO, NO,
          WE GOT PLANS.

114
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:15,274
         THIS BETTER NOT
          BE IMPORTANT.

115
00:06:15,341 --> 00:06:16,709
             [sighs]

116
00:06:16,776 --> 00:06:19,612
         I LOVE THAT YOU
       DON'T LISTEN TO ME!

117
00:06:23,616 --> 00:06:25,485
     - IS THAT BLACK BLOOD?

118
00:06:29,722 --> 00:06:31,457
      THAT'S OFFICER STARK.

119
00:06:36,562 --> 00:06:38,831
          - HE'S DEAD.

120
00:06:41,467 --> 00:06:43,936
          [folk music]

121
00:06:44,003 --> 00:06:52,011
               &l &l

122
00:07:16,602 --> 00:07:18,404
        - I JUST SAW HIM.

123
00:07:18,471 --> 00:07:21,407
         HE LOOKED PALE
      AND SWEATY, BUT NOT--

124
00:07:21,474 --> 00:07:23,576
         - NOT AS DEAD?

125
00:07:23,643 --> 00:07:26,712
            'CAUSE...
        HE'S PRETTY DEAD.

126
00:07:26,779 --> 00:07:28,181
     - LOOK, HIS VEINS ARE--

127
00:07:28,247 --> 00:07:29,749
         THEY'RE BLACK.

128
00:07:31,384 --> 00:07:34,020
         - WHAT THE HELL
            IS THIS?

129
00:07:34,086 --> 00:07:36,189
           IS THAT ONE
         OF MY OFFICERS?

130
00:07:37,423 --> 00:07:39,292
     - THAT'S CHIEF MERRILL.

131
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:44,764
       - AND WHO ARE YOU?
            - I AM...

132
00:07:45,798 --> 00:07:47,567
             NOBODY.

133
00:07:49,135 --> 00:07:51,737
       - WHAT DO YOU THINK
COULD CAUSE SOMETHING LIKE THIS?

134
00:07:51,804 --> 00:07:52,939
            - [sighs]

135
00:07:53,005 --> 00:07:55,041
   - MAYBE A CHEMICAL WEAPON.

136
00:07:55,107 --> 00:07:57,443
      - WE'RE NOT A TARGET
     FOR ANYTHING LIKE THAT.

137
00:07:57,510 --> 00:08:00,580
     - WE MAY WANNA CONSIDER
      OTHER POSSIBILITIES.

138
00:08:00,646 --> 00:08:03,683
   - ARE YOU SAYING THIS TOWN
DOESN'T HAVE ANY LOCAL FANATICS?

139
00:08:03,749 --> 00:08:06,686
 GROUPS WITH A REASON TO TARGET
  THE HAVEN POLICE DEPARTMENT?

140
00:08:06,752 --> 00:08:09,589
       I SUGGEST YOU LOOK
      INTO THAT RIGHT NOW.

141
00:08:11,157 --> 00:08:14,160
     [indistinct chattering]

142
00:08:16,128 --> 00:08:17,563
   - THIS ISN'T THE PENTAGON.

143
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:20,233
        WHO'S GONNA STAGE
   A CHEMICAL ATTACK IN HAVEN?

144
00:08:20,299 --> 00:08:21,901
     - THE MORE PEOPLE KNOW
       ABOUT THE TROUBLED,

145
00:08:25,238 --> 00:08:27,206
     - DO YOU THINK THE REV
      IS WHIPPING THEM UP?

146
00:08:27,273 --> 00:08:29,575
       - DUKE JUST TOLD ME
   THAT THE REV GOT ME FIRED.

147
00:08:29,642 --> 00:08:31,244
      - ARE YOU KIDDING ME?

148
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:33,145
        - I KNEW HE'D TRY
   AND GET ME OUT EVENTUALLY.

149
00:08:33,212 --> 00:08:35,248
     IT JUST HAPPENED SOONER
        THAN I EXPECTED.

150
00:08:35,314 --> 00:08:38,451
          - ALL RIGHT,
   SO THE REV GETS HIS CHIEF.

151
00:08:38,518 --> 00:08:40,219
           WHY ATTACK
       THE DEPARTMENT NOW?

152
00:08:40,286 --> 00:08:43,122
  - UNLESS THE PERP IS SOMEONE
     UNHAPPY ABOUT MERRILL.

153
00:08:43,189 --> 00:08:45,458
       - YOU GET REPLACED.
     YOU DO HAVE YOUR FANS.

154
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:48,160
           - YOU THINK
    IT'S SOMEONE PRO-TROUBLED

155
00:08:48,227 --> 00:08:50,696
     WITH TECHNICAL KNOWHOW,

156
00:08:50,763 --> 00:08:52,732
     ACCESS TO CHEMICALS...

157
00:08:52,798 --> 00:08:54,567
         THE LAST PERSON
    PAUL ARRESTED WAS DWIGHT.

158
00:08:54,634 --> 00:08:55,968
             - YEAH,
       YOUR DAD'S CLEANER.

159
00:08:56,035 --> 00:08:58,170
      WE REALLY DON'T KNOW
      THAT MUCH ABOUT HIM.

160
00:08:58,237 --> 00:09:00,840
          - HE'S DEAD?
    - MAYBE YOU HAD A GRUDGE.

161
00:09:00,907 --> 00:09:04,043
   - NATHAN, LISTEN, I DIDN'T
 DO ANYTHING TO THAT GUY, OKAY?

162
00:09:04,110 --> 00:09:05,511
         YOU REALLY NEED
      TO START TRUSTING ME.

163
00:09:05,578 --> 00:09:06,879
       WITH THE NEW CHIEF
            IN TOWN,

164
00:09:06,946 --> 00:09:08,481
        YOU MIGHT NEED ME
         MORE THAN EVER.

165
00:09:10,783 --> 00:09:13,286
             [sighs]

166
00:09:15,521 --> 00:09:17,223
   - WE'RE GONNA DO THIS NOW?

167
00:09:17,290 --> 00:09:20,359
             - WAIT.
              EVI.

168
00:09:20,426 --> 00:09:22,628
            SHOW HIM
       WHAT YOU SHOWED ME.

169
00:09:36,008 --> 00:09:37,944
         - IT STARTS AT
        THE EXTREMITIES.

170
00:09:38,010 --> 00:09:39,979
       - WE GOTTA GET HER
        TO THE HOSPITAL.

171
00:09:40,046 --> 00:09:42,081
       - HOW LONG HAS SHE
         BEEN LIKE THIS?

172
00:09:42,148 --> 00:09:44,350
          - EXCUSE ME.
   SHE'S STANDING RIGHT HERE.

173
00:09:44,417 --> 00:09:46,052
             - DUKE,
        WHAT'S HAPPENING?

174
00:09:46,118 --> 00:09:48,521
   - WERE YOU AND PARKER ABLE
 TO LOCATE THE CHEMICAL SOURCE?

175
00:09:48,588 --> 00:09:49,889
       - NO, NOT YET, SIR.

176
00:09:49,956 --> 00:09:52,191
         - DID YOU HAVE
       ANY DIRECT CONTACT

177
00:09:52,258 --> 00:09:53,559
       WITH OFFICER STARK?

178
00:09:53,626 --> 00:09:55,294
         SHAKE HIS HAND,
   SIT AT HIS DESK, ANYTHING?

179
00:09:55,361 --> 00:09:57,063
              - NO.

180
00:09:57,129 --> 00:09:58,397
        - BUT THIS THING
        KEEPS SPREADING.

181
00:09:58,464 --> 00:10:01,767
   SO IT'S GOTTA BE BIOLOGICAL
          AND AIRBORNE.

182
00:10:01,834 --> 00:10:03,536
             - SIR.

183
00:10:03,603 --> 00:10:05,338
   - MA'AM, I'LL NEED YOU BACK
  IN THE BREAK ROOM RIGHT NOW.

184
00:10:05,404 --> 00:10:07,073
     - WAIT A MINUTE, CHIEF.
             - NOW!

185
00:10:10,576 --> 00:10:12,011
      LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,

186
00:10:12,078 --> 00:10:14,647
 WE MAY HAVE A BIOLOGICAL AGENT
        IN THE BUILDING,

187
00:10:14,714 --> 00:10:17,516
           WHICH MEANS
      WE FOLLOW PROCEDURE.

188
00:10:17,583 --> 00:10:19,185
         WE CANNOT ALLOW
        THE CONTAMINATION

189
00:10:19,251 --> 00:10:20,620
       TO SPREAD FURTHER.

190
00:10:20,686 --> 00:10:23,589
     SO UNTIL THIS SITUATION
      IS RESOLVED, NOBODY--

191
00:10:23,656 --> 00:10:25,424
       AND I MEAN <i>NOBODY--</i>

192
00:10:25,491 --> 00:10:27,193
         GOES IN OR OUT
        OF THIS BUILDING.

193
00:10:27,259 --> 00:10:29,996
    THE HAVEN POLICE STATION
    IS NOW UNDER QUARANTINE.

194
00:10:30,062 --> 00:10:32,198
       THIS IS A LOCKDOWN.

195
00:10:32,264 --> 00:10:35,034
        [dramatic music]

196
00:10:35,101 --> 00:10:40,139
               &l &l

197
00:10:42,608 --> 00:10:44,744
   - THIS THING IS CONTAINED.
           ABSOLUTELY.

198
00:10:44,810 --> 00:10:46,979
  NO ONE'S LEAVING THE BUILDING
        UNTIL IT'S CLEAR.

199
00:10:48,881 --> 00:10:51,083
        I'LL DO WHATEVER
         HAS TO BE DONE.

200
00:10:53,319 --> 00:10:55,054
           COPY THAT.

201
00:10:55,121 --> 00:10:57,823
           I'LL AWAIT
      FURTHER INSTRUCTION.

202
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:04,163
   - WHAT DO THE STATE POLICE
          HAVE TO SAY?

203
00:11:06,165 --> 00:11:08,901
       - THAT WE'RE DOING
        THE RIGHT THING.

204
00:11:08,968 --> 00:11:11,971
   THE CONTAGION HASN'T SPREAD
   BEYOND THE POLICE STATION.

205
00:11:13,973 --> 00:11:15,541
          - ALL RIGHT.

206
00:11:15,608 --> 00:11:18,277
   LIKE YOU ASKED, IT'S A LIST
   OF EVERYONE IN THE STATION.

207
00:11:18,344 --> 00:11:20,179
       IT'S A SMALL GROUP.

208
00:11:21,614 --> 00:11:24,250
       - HUGH UNDERWOOD--
         HE'S A DOCTOR?

209
00:11:24,316 --> 00:11:26,419
- HE SAID HE'D LOOK AT THE BODY,
       CHECK ON THE SICK.

210
00:11:26,485 --> 00:11:29,188
             - GOOD.

211
00:11:29,255 --> 00:11:32,058
        HAVE THE OFFICERS
    KEEP AN EYE ON EVERYBODY.

212
00:11:32,124 --> 00:11:34,427
   - SIR, THE PEOPLE OUT THERE
   ARE SCARED FOR THEIR LIVES.

213
00:11:34,493 --> 00:11:35,761
         - WELL, THAT'S
         TO BE EXPECTED.

214
00:11:35,828 --> 00:11:37,596
       THAT'S WHY WE HAVE
       TO MAINTAIN ORDER.

215
00:11:37,663 --> 00:11:39,432
        I PUT LOCK CODES
        ON ALL THE DOORS.

216
00:11:39,498 --> 00:11:42,401
        ALL THE LANDLINES
         ARE SHUT DOWN.

217
00:11:42,468 --> 00:11:44,770
    I WANT YOU TO CONFISCATE
     EVERYBODY'S CELL PHONE.

218
00:11:44,837 --> 00:11:47,039
    - PEOPLE WILL WANNA STAY
  IN TOUCH WITH THEIR FAMILIES.

219
00:11:47,106 --> 00:11:48,507
       - AND I'LL NEED YOU
 AND THE REST OF THE DEPARTMENT

220
00:11:48,574 --> 00:11:49,842
   TO SURRENDER YOUR WEAPONS.

221
00:11:49,909 --> 00:11:51,510
             - WHAT?
 - THEY'LL BE PLACED IN A LOCKER

222
00:11:51,577 --> 00:11:53,312
          UNDER MY OWN
      PERSONAL ACCESS CODE.

223
00:11:53,379 --> 00:11:54,980
         WE CAN'T AFFORD
       SOMEONE PANICKING,

224
00:11:55,047 --> 00:11:56,782
      DOING SOMETHING RASH.

225
00:11:58,217 --> 00:12:00,886
      THIS ISN'T OPTIONAL.

226
00:12:16,068 --> 00:12:17,536
     - WE CAN LEAVE ANYTIME.

227
00:12:17,603 --> 00:12:19,105
          I'LL JUST USE
      MY IRRESISTIBLE CHARM

228
00:12:19,171 --> 00:12:20,439
        ON YOUR NEW BOSS.

229
00:12:20,506 --> 00:12:21,974
       - IT'S RESISTIBLE.

230
00:12:25,311 --> 00:12:26,712
      - WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

231
00:12:26,779 --> 00:12:28,380
    - JUST A LITTLE INSURANCE
       IN CASE, YOU KNOW,

232
00:12:28,447 --> 00:12:30,049
         MERRILL STARTS
     SEARCHING THE OFFICES.

233
00:12:30,116 --> 00:12:32,685
  I WANNA MAKE SURE I CAN FIND
        AT LEAST ONE GUN.

234
00:12:32,752 --> 00:12:34,954
      - PARKER, YOU CALLED?
             - YEAH.

235
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:36,655
            STAN, YOU
       AND THE DESK SARGE,

236
00:12:36,722 --> 00:12:38,891
 YOU'RE THE ONLY ONE WITH ACCESS
  TO THE EVIDENCE ROOM, RIGHT?

237
00:12:38,958 --> 00:12:40,726
            - RIGHT.
     - BOOK THIS IN EVIDENCE

238
00:12:40,793 --> 00:12:42,161
      AND KEEP IT THAT WAY.

239
00:12:42,228 --> 00:12:43,863
          - YOU GOT IT.

240
00:12:52,938 --> 00:12:55,207
         - CAN YOU TELL
     WHAT'S HAPPENED TO HIM?

241
00:12:55,274 --> 00:12:57,376
     - WELL, IT'S STRANGE--

242
00:12:57,443 --> 00:13:00,746
      THIS, UM, DARK BLOOD.

243
00:13:00,813 --> 00:13:03,883
  I KNOW WHAT YOUR CHIEF SAID,
      BUT CHEMICAL WEAPONS,

244
00:13:03,949 --> 00:13:05,351
    THEY DON'T ACT LIKE THIS.

245
00:13:05,417 --> 00:13:07,753
  - DO YOU THINK IT'S A VIRUS?
              - NO.

246
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:10,322
     NO, VIRUSES DON'T MOVE
    WITH THIS KIND OF SPEED.

247
00:13:10,389 --> 00:13:12,825
    IT'S NOT LIKE ANY POISON
         I'VE EVER SEEN.

248
00:13:12,892 --> 00:13:15,227
        IT'S LIKE NOTHING
  IN THE KNOWN MEDICAL RECORD.

249
00:13:15,294 --> 00:13:17,329
     - ALL RIGHT. THANK YOU,
         DR. UNDERWOOD.

250
00:13:17,396 --> 00:13:19,899
      - HEY, CALL ME HUGH.

251
00:13:22,501 --> 00:13:25,404
     - I DON'T THINK HAVEN'S
  IN THE KNOWN MEDICAL RECORD.

252
00:13:25,471 --> 00:13:26,872
         - IT'S GOTTA BE
          THE TROUBLES.

253
00:13:26,939 --> 00:13:30,075
      - SO WHOSE AFFLICTION
   IS SPREADING THIS DISEASE?

254
00:13:31,610 --> 00:13:34,513
    - THE PERSON IS PROBABLY
      STILL IN THE STATION.

255
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:37,883
 THEY COULD BE INFECTING WHOEVER
 THEY'RE COMING IN CONTACT WITH.

256
00:13:37,950 --> 00:13:40,386
    - OKAY, SO THIS HAPPENED,
   WHAT, ABOUT 45 MINUTES AGO,

257
00:13:40,452 --> 00:13:42,054
      AND WE'VE ALREADY GOT
           A NEW CASE?

258
00:13:42,121 --> 00:13:43,355
    THAT MEANS THAT ALL OF US
          COULD BE SICK

259
00:13:43,422 --> 00:13:45,524
    WITHIN A MATTER OF HOURS.

260
00:13:45,591 --> 00:13:47,526
       I'M GONNA GO AHEAD
        AND CHECK ON EVI.

261
00:13:47,593 --> 00:13:49,195
     - DWIGHT, IT'S NATHAN.
          DO YOU READ?

262
00:13:49,261 --> 00:13:52,097
             - WOW.
        OUTSIDE CONTACT.

263
00:13:52,164 --> 00:13:54,934
         I'M GONNA TELL
      THE NEW CHIEF ON YOU.

264
00:13:59,939 --> 00:14:01,207
            - DWIGHT.

265
00:14:01,273 --> 00:14:02,575
       - IT'S ABOUT TIME.

266
00:14:02,641 --> 00:14:03,876
         WHAT THE HELL'S
       GOING ON UP THERE?

267
00:14:03,943 --> 00:14:05,544
       - WE GOT SOME KIND
        OF OUTBREAK HERE.

268
00:14:05,611 --> 00:14:07,012
         - MY BUDDY FROM
    THE STATE POLICE CALLED.

269
00:14:07,079 --> 00:14:08,347
     SAID THEY GOT A TIPOFF.

270
00:14:08,414 --> 00:14:09,982
       ANY CALL FROM HAVEN
           IS A PRANK.

271
00:14:10,049 --> 00:14:11,817
           C.D.C. GOT
        THE SAME WARNING.

272
00:14:11,884 --> 00:14:13,986
 I FIGURED THERE WERE SOMETHING
 YOU WERE TRYING TO KEEP QUIET.

273
00:14:14,053 --> 00:14:17,122
   - NO, I GUESS SOMEBODY IS.

274
00:14:17,189 --> 00:14:18,958
    WE'RE CUT OFF COMPLETELY.

275
00:14:19,024 --> 00:14:20,426
         - THINK SOMEONE
          PLANNED THIS?

276
00:14:20,492 --> 00:14:22,428
    - I DON'T KNOW. JUST STAY
     BY THE RADIO RIGHT NOW.

277
00:14:22,494 --> 00:14:25,197
     YOU'RE MY ONLY BACKUP.
          - ROGER THAT.

278
00:14:32,438 --> 00:14:34,373
    - HEY. I CHECKED ON EVI.
      SHE'S GETTING WORSE.

279
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,408
   AND NOW THIS OTHER WOMAN'S
           GOT IT TOO.

280
00:14:36,475 --> 00:14:39,545
      - SOMEBODY CALLED OFF
 THE STATE POLICE AND THE C.D.C.

281
00:14:39,612 --> 00:14:41,146
          - WHAT? WHY?

282
00:14:41,213 --> 00:14:45,317
      - I'M MORE INTERESTED
    IN WHO WANTS US CUT OFF.

283
00:14:45,384 --> 00:14:47,820
         - DO YOU THINK
    THAT MERRILL'S TROUBLED?

284
00:14:47,887 --> 00:14:50,923
 - YOU DON'T THINK THE REV WOULD
   VET HIS NEW PICK FOR CHIEF?

285
00:14:50,990 --> 00:14:52,925
   - OKAY, LOOK, IT'S NOT LIKE
   THERE'S A TEST, ALL RIGHT?

286
00:14:52,992 --> 00:14:55,661
     MAYBE HE'S ISOLATING US
      TO COVER HIS TRACKS.

287
00:14:55,728 --> 00:14:58,664
      - WE GOTTA BE SMART,
 TRY AND REASON WITH HIM FIRST.

288
00:15:01,133 --> 00:15:02,534
          - ANY PERSON
      LEAVING THIS BUILDING

289
00:15:02,601 --> 00:15:03,869
     WILL BE SHOT ON SIGHT.

290
00:15:03,936 --> 00:15:06,138
         - SHOT? BY WHO?

291
00:15:06,205 --> 00:15:07,840
     - THIS IS AN OUTBREAK.

292
00:15:07,907 --> 00:15:10,576
    IT NEEDS TO BE CONTAINED.

293
00:15:10,643 --> 00:15:12,278
       THERE ARE ARMED MEN
      OUTSIDE THIS BUILDING

294
00:15:12,344 --> 00:15:14,113
      WHO WILL SHOOT ANYONE
          SEEN LEAVING,

295
00:15:14,179 --> 00:15:16,782
  AND THEY WILL ONLY STAND DOWN
          ON MY ORDER.

296
00:15:16,849 --> 00:15:18,284
     - WHO THE HELL ARE YOU?

297
00:15:18,350 --> 00:15:20,986
     - I'M THE GUY BRINGING
    THIS PLACE UNDER CONTROL.

298
00:15:22,321 --> 00:15:23,956
          - OKAY, SIR,

299
00:15:24,023 --> 00:15:26,058
    HAVE YOU EVER CONSIDERED
         THE POSSIBILITY

300
00:15:26,125 --> 00:15:28,294
        THAT MAYBE YOU'RE
      THE ONE CAUSING THIS?

301
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,796
           - YOU THINK
          I'M TROUBLED?

302
00:15:30,863 --> 00:15:34,466
          THE TROUBLED
        ARE WHY I'M HERE.

303
00:15:34,533 --> 00:15:36,335
  PEOPLE ARE SICK AND TIRED OF
 A TOWN THAT LOOKS THE OTHER WAY

304
00:15:36,402 --> 00:15:38,337
       WHILE THE TROUBLED
         BREAK THE LAW.

305
00:15:38,404 --> 00:15:40,472
   - THE REV BROUGHT YOU HERE,
           DIDN'T HE?

306
00:15:40,539 --> 00:15:42,474
           - I'M HERE
      TO ENFORCE THE LAW...

307
00:15:42,541 --> 00:15:43,976
          - OH, MY GOD.
             CHIEF.

308
00:15:44,043 --> 00:15:45,711
     - TO TREAT THE TROUBLED
       FOR WHAT THEY ARE--

309
00:15:45,778 --> 00:15:47,179
           CRIMINALS!

310
00:15:47,246 --> 00:15:49,181
             WE HAVE
       TO MAINTAIN ORDER.

311
00:15:49,248 --> 00:15:51,350
             WE HAVE
        TO CONTAIN THIS.

312
00:15:51,417 --> 00:15:54,420
            NO ONE IS
      LEAVING HERE UNTIL...

313
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,528
            [coughs]

314
00:16:04,596 --> 00:16:06,799
          OH, DAMN IT.

315
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:10,169
      YOUR KIND WON'T WIN.

316
00:16:11,804 --> 00:16:13,305
             [thud]

317
00:16:27,052 --> 00:16:28,654
     - FOR NOW JUST GO AHEAD
   AND PUT HIM IN THE BATHROOM

318
00:16:28,721 --> 00:16:30,255
           WITH PAUL.

319
00:16:30,322 --> 00:16:31,657
     - MERRILL'S CELL PHONE.

320
00:16:31,724 --> 00:16:33,792
    IT'S PASSWORD-PROTECTED,
           OF COURSE.

321
00:16:33,859 --> 00:16:35,995
      BUT HE MUST'VE KNOWN
HE WAS INFECTED THIS WHOLE TIME.

322
00:16:36,061 --> 00:16:37,930
       MAYBE HE REALLY DID
   WANNA CONTAIN THE OUTBREAK.

323
00:16:37,997 --> 00:16:41,600
    - OR HE WAS TERRIFIED BY
 WHOEVER WAS GIVING HIM ORDERS.

324
00:16:41,667 --> 00:16:43,936
      - DWIGHT, DO YOU SEE
       ANYBODY OUT THERE?

325
00:16:44,003 --> 00:16:45,337
         - AFFIRMATIVE.

326
00:16:45,404 --> 00:16:46,939
      I'M NOT THE ONLY ONE
      WATCHING THE STATION.

327
00:16:47,006 --> 00:16:49,375
 YOU GOT TWO ARMED WITH HANDGUNS
        ON THE PERIMETER,

328
00:16:49,441 --> 00:16:51,443
 AT LEAST ONE ON THE ROOFTOP
     OF THE POST OFFICE

329
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:53,212
       ACROSS THE STREET,
     PACKING A SNIPER RIFLE.

330
00:16:53,278 --> 00:16:55,047
         - HEAD OVER TO
    THE SHERIFF'S DEPARTMENT

331
00:16:55,114 --> 00:16:56,382
         AND SEE IF YOU
     CAN GET US SOME BACKUP.

332
00:16:56,448 --> 00:16:57,750
           - WILL DO.

333
00:17:04,390 --> 00:17:05,891
         - GOT MERRILL'S
          ACCESS CARD.

334
00:17:05,958 --> 00:17:07,726
         WE CAN OVERRIDE
      THE ELECTRONIC LOCKS.

335
00:17:07,793 --> 00:17:09,028
         WE CAN GET OUT
            OF HERE.

336
00:17:09,094 --> 00:17:10,963
           - OF COURSE
     WE CAN'T REALLY USE IT.

337
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:13,632
   I MEAN, EVEN IF THESE GUYS
   OUTSIDE ARE JUST FOR SHOW,

338
00:17:13,699 --> 00:17:14,867
          WE CAN'T LET
         THIS THING OUT.

339
00:17:14,933 --> 00:17:16,402
        IT COULD WIPE OUT
          ALL OF HAVEN.

340
00:17:16,468 --> 00:17:17,736
      - OKAY, IT LOOKS LIKE
  THAT THIS THING KILLS PEOPLE

341
00:17:17,803 --> 00:17:19,071
         IN A FEW HOURS,

342
00:17:19,138 --> 00:17:20,706
     SO WE REALLY DON'T HAVE
         THAT MUCH TIME.

343
00:17:20,773 --> 00:17:22,241
      I'M PROBABLY IMMUNE.

344
00:17:22,307 --> 00:17:25,244
      I'M JUST GONNA START
 INTERVIEWING PEOPLE ONE BY ONE.

345
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:27,846
          - EXCEPT EVI.
           SHE'S MINE.

346
00:17:30,282 --> 00:17:32,518
         - I NEED TO GET
         TO A HOSPITAL.

347
00:17:32,584 --> 00:17:34,920
         - WE CAN'T RISK
     LETTING YOU OUT THERE.

348
00:17:34,987 --> 00:17:37,689
          WE DON'T KNOW
      IF YOU'RE CONTAGIOUS.

349
00:17:39,124 --> 00:17:41,026
           WHOA, WHOA.

350
00:17:49,668 --> 00:17:51,937
              EVI.

351
00:17:52,004 --> 00:17:55,307
   THAT'S NOT THE ONLY REASON
          WHY I'M HERE.

352
00:17:57,076 --> 00:17:59,011
         I NEED TO KNOW
       WHY YOU SOLD ME OUT

353
00:17:59,078 --> 00:18:00,512
        TO THE SELECTMEN,

354
00:18:00,579 --> 00:18:02,548
     GOT ME FIRED AS CHIEF.

355
00:18:02,614 --> 00:18:04,716
       WHY ARE YOU WORKING
          WITH THE REV?

356
00:18:04,783 --> 00:18:06,251
      - HOW'D YOU FIND OUT?

357
00:18:06,318 --> 00:18:08,620
             - DUKE.

358
00:18:08,687 --> 00:18:10,856
    HE SAW YOUR TEXT MESSAGE.

359
00:18:13,492 --> 00:18:16,695
     - THAT'S WHY HE'S BEEN
       ACTING SO STRANGE.

360
00:18:16,762 --> 00:18:18,797
              LOOK,
      THIS WASN'T PERSONAL.

361
00:18:18,864 --> 00:18:20,966
      I--I GOT IN TOO DEEP.

362
00:18:21,033 --> 00:18:22,768
  AND THAT'S WHEN THEY ASKED ME
        TO DO THAT THING

363
00:18:22,835 --> 00:18:24,069
        WITH YOUR FILES.

364
00:18:24,136 --> 00:18:25,737
         - WHO'S "THEY"?
            THE REV?

365
00:18:25,804 --> 00:18:27,206
       - HE'S ONE OF THEM.

366
00:18:27,272 --> 00:18:30,642
    - WHY IS IT SO IMPORTANT
   TO HAVE ME OUT OF THE WAY?

367
00:18:30,709 --> 00:18:33,045
     - BECAUSE THEY SAID IT
     WOULD BE HELPING DUKE.

368
00:18:33,112 --> 00:18:34,813
       - EXPLAIN IT TO ME.
           - I CAN'T.

369
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:37,316
        - THEN EXPLAIN IT
             TO ME.

370
00:18:52,131 --> 00:18:53,565
          - I'M SORRY.
           THESE MEN,

371
00:18:53,632 --> 00:18:55,467
         THEY SAID THAT
       I'D BE HELPING YOU.

372
00:18:55,534 --> 00:18:58,003
 - HOW DOES GETTING NATHAN FIRED
        POSSIBLY HELP ME?

373
00:18:58,070 --> 00:18:59,304
       - I--I DON'T KNOW,
              OKAY?

374
00:18:59,371 --> 00:19:02,074
       THEY SAID THAT YOU
         WERE IMPORTANT,

375
00:19:02,141 --> 00:19:03,909
       AND THAT YOU NEEDED
    TO LEARN CERTAIN THINGS,

376
00:19:03,976 --> 00:19:06,378
     AND NATHAN NEEDED TO BE
         OUT OF THE WAY

377
00:19:06,445 --> 00:19:07,813
         BECAUSE IT'D BE
       A PROBLEM FOR YOU.

378
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,815
            - [sighs]

379
00:19:18,023 --> 00:19:21,660
       HOW NAIVE ARE YOU?

380
00:19:23,529 --> 00:19:25,297
    OR DID THEY JUST PAY YOU
         A LOT OF MONEY?

381
00:19:25,364 --> 00:19:27,132
          - OH, MY GOD.
    IT'S NOT ABOUT THE MONEY.

382
00:19:27,199 --> 00:19:28,634
     I BELIEVED THEM, OKAY?

383
00:19:28,700 --> 00:19:31,170
     I BELIEVED THEM BECAUSE
     THEY TOLD ME SOMETHING

384
00:19:31,236 --> 00:19:33,205
       THAT I ALWAYS KNEW.

385
00:19:33,272 --> 00:19:34,540
         YOU'RE SPECIAL.

386
00:19:34,606 --> 00:19:36,375
            - MM-HMM.

387
00:19:36,441 --> 00:19:39,111
        AND WHAT MAKES ME
           SO SPECIAL?

388
00:19:39,178 --> 00:19:40,479
          - ALL I KNOW

389
00:19:40,546 --> 00:19:42,848
   IS THAT WHATEVER'S GOING ON
          IN THIS TOWN,

390
00:19:42,915 --> 00:19:44,483
     THEY THINK THAT YOU'RE
      IN THE MIDDLE OF IT.

391
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:48,020
        - WHAT? TELL ME!
            TELL ME!

392
00:19:48,086 --> 00:19:50,656
   - I CAN'T! I'M TELLING YOU
          WHAT I KNOW!

393
00:19:50,722 --> 00:19:53,025
       - AFTER EVERYTHING,
  YOU OWE ME SOME REAL ANSWERS.

394
00:19:53,091 --> 00:19:55,160
            - [sighs]
           - SO WHAT?

395
00:19:55,227 --> 00:19:56,995
        EVERYTHING THAT'S
       HAPPENED BETWEEN US

396
00:19:57,062 --> 00:19:58,530
         WAS CONTROLLED
            BY THEM.

397
00:19:58,597 --> 00:20:02,501
            - NO. NO.
        - YOU COULD DIE.

398
00:20:02,568 --> 00:20:05,437
        WE ALL COULD DIE.

399
00:20:05,504 --> 00:20:07,105
          THERE ARE MEN
      OUT THERE WITH GUNS,

400
00:20:07,172 --> 00:20:09,608
           STOPPING US
          FROM LEAVING.

401
00:20:12,911 --> 00:20:17,316
      EVEN WITH ALL THAT...

402
00:20:17,382 --> 00:20:20,419
         YOU STILL CAN'T
       TELL ME THE TRUTH.

403
00:20:29,228 --> 00:20:30,896
        [door slams shut]

404
00:20:35,601 --> 00:20:37,636
          - [sniffles]

405
00:20:50,616 --> 00:20:52,618
             [gasps]

406
00:21:02,594 --> 00:21:04,229
      - UH, NIKKI COLEMAN.

407
00:21:04,296 --> 00:21:07,532
    I CAME IN TO FILE A, UH,
  BUILDING PERMIT FOR MY BOSS.

408
00:21:07,599 --> 00:21:09,268
         - OKAY, GREAT.
    AND DID YOU TALK TO, UH,

409
00:21:09,334 --> 00:21:11,403
          CHIEF MERRILL
        OR OFFICER STARK?

410
00:21:11,470 --> 00:21:12,871
    - I TALKED WITH EVERYONE.

411
00:21:12,938 --> 00:21:14,973
      THEY KEPT TELLING ME
     TO FILL OUT MORE FORMS.

412
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:16,675
         DOES THIS MEAN
         WE CAN GO NOW?

413
00:21:16,742 --> 00:21:18,210
          - YEAH, SOON.

414
00:21:18,277 --> 00:21:20,279
    UM, CAN YOU JUST GO AHEAD
  AND SEND IN THE NEXT PERSON?

415
00:21:20,345 --> 00:21:22,748
             - YEAH.

416
00:21:25,317 --> 00:21:27,286
            - [sighs]

417
00:21:27,352 --> 00:21:29,121
       THIS IS RIDICULOUS.

418
00:21:29,187 --> 00:21:30,889
          DO WE REALLY
        HAVE TO DO THIS?

419
00:21:30,956 --> 00:21:32,557
        - WELL, YOU KNOW
    I CAN'T MAKE IT LOOK LIKE

420
00:21:32,624 --> 00:21:34,426
         YOU'RE GETTING
       SPECIAL TREATMENT.

421
00:21:34,493 --> 00:21:36,962
      - FINE. I'LL MAKE IT
          EASY FOR YA.

422
00:21:37,029 --> 00:21:39,031
          IT'S NOT ME.
          NOW CAN I GO?

423
00:21:39,097 --> 00:21:40,699
     I'VE GOT A KILLER GAME
       OF SOLITAIRE GOING.

424
00:21:40,766 --> 00:21:42,534
     IT'S THE ONLY CARD GAME
    WHERE NOBODY LETS ME WIN.

425
00:21:42,601 --> 00:21:45,337
      - HAVE YOU SEEN EVI?
 SHE'S MISSING. DUKE'S WORRIED.

426
00:21:45,404 --> 00:21:48,240
        - WELL, SHE CAN'T
          BE THAT FAR.

427
00:21:48,307 --> 00:21:51,176
      - THE KEYCARD'S GONE.
        EVI MUST HAVE IT.

428
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:56,782
         [scanner beeps]

429
00:22:00,585 --> 00:22:02,954
        - WHERE ARE YOU?

430
00:22:03,021 --> 00:22:04,623
             - EVI.
    - I KNOW YOU'RE OUT HERE!

431
00:22:04,690 --> 00:22:06,191
            COME ON!
          - EVI, STOP!

432
00:22:06,258 --> 00:22:08,493
        PLEASE, JUST COME
          BACK INSIDE.

433
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:10,962
         - NO. I GOT OUT
            FOR YOU.

434
00:22:11,029 --> 00:22:14,299
      I COULD RUN, BUT I'M
     NOT GONNA RUN ANYMORE.

435
00:22:14,366 --> 00:22:17,035
      IF YOU WANT ANSWERS,
   I'LL GET YOU YOUR ANSWERS.

436
00:22:19,237 --> 00:22:20,238
             - EVI!

437
00:22:20,305 --> 00:22:21,473
         [scanner beeps]

438
00:22:21,540 --> 00:22:23,342
   - GO BACK TO THE BUILDING.
              - NO!

439
00:22:23,408 --> 00:22:25,477
      YOU'RE GONNA TELL HIM
     WHAT HE WANTS TO KNOW--

440
00:22:25,544 --> 00:22:28,313
            [gunshot]
             - EVI!

441
00:22:28,380 --> 00:22:29,614
          [rifle cocks]

442
00:22:29,681 --> 00:22:31,216
        - HOLD YOUR FIRE!
            NOT HIM!

443
00:22:38,757 --> 00:22:41,593
        - YOU'RE GONNA BE
           ALL RIGHT.

444
00:22:48,166 --> 00:22:50,469
           - OH, GOD.

445
00:22:50,535 --> 00:22:53,338
          I'M GONNA GO
         GET SOME HELP.

446
00:22:53,405 --> 00:22:54,673
      - [breathes heavily]

447
00:22:54,740 --> 00:22:56,608
      WHY DID YOU DO THAT?

448
00:22:58,110 --> 00:23:00,212
         - I'M SO SORRY.

449
00:23:00,278 --> 00:23:04,816
           - HANG ON.
       HELP'S ON THE WAY.

450
00:23:45,624 --> 00:23:48,527
      - [breathing heavily]
       - NO, NO. NO, DUKE.

451
00:23:48,593 --> 00:23:50,262
         NOT LIKE THIS.

452
00:23:51,296 --> 00:23:53,098
       - IF YOU WERE EVER
           MY FRIEND--

453
00:23:53,165 --> 00:23:55,767
 - YOU CAN'T JUST RUN OUT THERE!
      BE SMARTER THAN THAT.

454
00:23:55,834 --> 00:23:57,769
     - NATHAN, GET THE HELL
         OUT OF MY WAY!

455
00:23:57,836 --> 00:24:01,506
             - DUKE!
         - AUDREY, YOU--

456
00:24:03,141 --> 00:24:04,476
            - NATHAN!

457
00:24:05,844 --> 00:24:08,613
    - I JUST SAVED HIS LIFE.

458
00:24:08,680 --> 00:24:10,782
       - ALL RIGHT, WELL,
     I'M GONNA GO FIGURE OUT

459
00:24:10,849 --> 00:24:12,851
        HOW TO STOP THIS.

460
00:24:22,594 --> 00:24:24,229
       [drawer bangs shut]

461
00:24:41,179 --> 00:24:43,548
         NIKKI COLEMAN.

462
00:24:44,850 --> 00:24:46,785
     YOU DIDN'T MENTION THAT
    OFFICER STARK MADE A CALL

463
00:24:46,852 --> 00:24:48,587
        TO YOUR RESIDENCE
         EARLIER TODAY,

464
00:24:48,653 --> 00:24:51,022
       THAT YOU WERE ALSO
   IN CHIEF MERRILL'S OFFICE.

465
00:24:51,089 --> 00:24:52,691
    AND NOW THEY'RE BOTH DEAD

466
00:24:52,757 --> 00:24:54,626
        THREE HOURS AFTER
       THEY TALKED TO YOU.

467
00:24:54,693 --> 00:24:55,961
     - I--I WANNA HELP YOU,

468
00:24:56,027 --> 00:24:58,930
       BUT I CAN'T BE SEEN
         TALKING TO YOU.

469
00:24:58,997 --> 00:24:59,998
        [knocks on door]
            - AUDREY.

470
00:25:00,065 --> 00:25:01,399
        - CHRIS, NOT NOW.

471
00:25:01,466 --> 00:25:03,034
     - THEN I GUESS I WON'T
      BOTHER YOU WITH THIS.

472
00:25:03,101 --> 00:25:05,837
         - HELLO AGAIN.
              - HI.

473
00:25:05,904 --> 00:25:08,607
   - YOU TALKED TO NIKKI TOO?
    - YEAH, SHE TALKED TO ME.

474
00:25:08,673 --> 00:25:11,076
              WHY?

475
00:25:11,142 --> 00:25:12,310
         SHE'S THE ONE?

476
00:25:12,377 --> 00:25:14,779
  BE A DOLL AND CLEAR THIS UP,
            WILL YA?

477
00:25:14,846 --> 00:25:16,481
         DO THAT VOODOO
          THAT YOU DO.

478
00:25:16,548 --> 00:25:18,283
      - I DON'T UNDERSTAND.

479
00:25:18,350 --> 00:25:20,619
        - YOU'RE THE ONE
  THAT'S CAUSING THIS DISEASE,

480
00:25:20,685 --> 00:25:21,920
         SO JUST FIX IT,
            WILL YOU?

481
00:25:21,987 --> 00:25:23,088
             - OKAY.

482
00:25:23,154 --> 00:25:24,990
         I HAVEN'T EVEN
          TOLD HER YET.

483
00:25:25,056 --> 00:25:26,358
          - I'M DYING.

484
00:25:26,424 --> 00:25:27,626
      GIVE ME FIVE MINUTES
       WITH PATIENT ZERO.

485
00:25:27,692 --> 00:25:29,394
  I'LL HAVE HER HEALING LEPERS.
          LOOK AT HER.

486
00:25:29,461 --> 00:25:31,263
        SHE'S PRACTICALLY
        IN LOVE WITH ME.

487
00:25:31,329 --> 00:25:33,131
   - WHAT HAS HAPPENED TO YOU?
   YOU'VE COMPLETELY CHANGED.

488
00:25:33,198 --> 00:25:34,799
        - YEAH, WHATEVER.
   I'M GOING TO THE HOSPITAL.

489
00:25:34,866 --> 00:25:37,235
  - NO, YOU CAN'T LEAVE, OKAY?
PEOPLE OUT THERE WILL SHOOT YOU.

490
00:25:37,302 --> 00:25:39,070
   - NOBODY WANTS TO SHOOT ME.
            - REALLY?

491
00:25:39,137 --> 00:25:41,373
       YOU'RE A SCIENTIST.
  TELL ME, WHAT WORKS FASTER--

492
00:25:41,439 --> 00:25:42,741
    YOUR TROUBLE OR A BULLET?

493
00:25:42,807 --> 00:25:44,910
     LISTEN, I CAN SAVE YOU

494
00:25:44,976 --> 00:25:46,545
 IF YOU JUST LET ME GET THROUGH
      TO THIS VERY SCARED,

495
00:25:46,611 --> 00:25:48,713
     AND NOW, THANKS TO YOU,
      VERY CONFUSED WOMAN.

496
00:25:48,780 --> 00:25:50,715
           ALL RIGHT?
     JUST LET ME DO MY JOB.

497
00:25:50,782 --> 00:25:53,418
   - MAN, I WISH MY AFFLICTION
         WORKED ON YOU.

498
00:25:55,620 --> 00:25:57,222
       - USUALLY A TROUBLE
           LIKE YOURS

499
00:25:57,289 --> 00:25:59,224
          IS TRIGGERED
      BY A TRAUMATIC EVENT.

500
00:25:59,291 --> 00:26:02,060
     DID SOMETHING LIKE THAT
        HAPPEN RECENTLY?

501
00:26:05,530 --> 00:26:07,899
             PLEASE.
        YOU CAN TELL ME.

502
00:26:07,966 --> 00:26:09,901
         - NO, LIKE, I--

503
00:26:09,968 --> 00:26:13,638
         YOU DON'T SEE--
    I--I CAN'T SAY ANYTHING.

504
00:26:14,873 --> 00:26:16,308
           HE'S BACK.

505
00:26:16,374 --> 00:26:20,111
    AND HE'LL HURT ME AGAIN,
          KILL ME EVEN.

506
00:26:20,178 --> 00:26:23,214
        - IS THAT WHY YOU
      CALLED OFFICER STARK?

507
00:26:23,281 --> 00:26:25,917
    IS THAT WHY YOU CAME DOWN
         TO THE STATION?

508
00:26:25,984 --> 00:26:28,887
         BECAUSE YOU'RE
          BEING ABUSED?

509
00:26:35,126 --> 00:26:37,228
     OKAY, LISTEN, THAT MAN
     THAT YOU'RE AFRAID OF,

510
00:26:37,295 --> 00:26:39,197
     HE CAN'T HURT YOU HERE,
           ALL RIGHT?

511
00:26:39,264 --> 00:26:40,565
          YOU'RE SAFE.

512
00:26:40,632 --> 00:26:42,901
      - NO, I'M NEVER SAFE.

513
00:26:42,968 --> 00:26:45,070
    YOU DON'T UNDERSTAND. I--

514
00:26:45,136 --> 00:26:47,639
        IT TOOK ME YEARS.

515
00:26:47,706 --> 00:26:51,142
           I RAN AWAY.
       I CHANGED MY NAME.

516
00:26:52,444 --> 00:26:54,245
       TODAY HE FOUND ME.

517
00:26:55,647 --> 00:26:57,248
       HE SAID IF I TALKED
          TO THE POLICE

518
00:26:57,315 --> 00:26:59,684
         HE'LL KILL ME.

519
00:27:00,719 --> 00:27:02,988
            - [sighs]

520
00:27:03,054 --> 00:27:04,723
         UH, EXCUSE ME.

521
00:27:04,789 --> 00:27:07,926
             UM, HI.
       I'M HUGH UNDERWOOD.

522
00:27:07,993 --> 00:27:09,928
          I'M A DOCTOR.
      - YEAH, CHRIS BRODY.

523
00:27:09,995 --> 00:27:12,764
      I'D SHAKE YOUR HAND,
   BUT I'M PRETTY MUCH DYING.

524
00:27:12,831 --> 00:27:14,232
        - AH, I'M SORRY,
             CHRIS.

525
00:27:14,299 --> 00:27:16,768
   UM, I JUST SAW YOU IN THERE
       WITH THE DETECTIVE

526
00:27:16,835 --> 00:27:18,470
            AND THAT,
        UM, NIKKI WOMAN.

527
00:27:18,536 --> 00:27:19,738
        WHAT'S GOING ON?

528
00:27:19,804 --> 00:27:21,206
        - MY GIRLFRIEND,
       OR WHATEVER SHE IS,

529
00:27:21,272 --> 00:27:22,440
         DOESN'T WANT ME
            TO LEAVE.

530
00:27:22,507 --> 00:27:23,675
      SHE'S THE DETECTIVE.

531
00:27:23,742 --> 00:27:25,310
         SHE'S IN THERE
       CHATTING UP A STORM

532
00:27:25,377 --> 00:27:26,945
       WHILE I'M OUT HERE
             DYING.

533
00:27:27,012 --> 00:27:28,980
        - I MIGHT BE ABLE
          TO HELP YOU.

534
00:27:29,047 --> 00:27:30,749
        IF I CAN GET YOU
    TO THE HOSPITAL IN TIME,

535
00:27:30,815 --> 00:27:33,451
         I MIGHT BE ABLE
       TO SAVE YOUR LIFE.

536
00:27:33,518 --> 00:27:35,120
       THE ONLY THING IS,
         THERE'S NO WAY

537
00:27:35,186 --> 00:27:37,122
      THEY'RE GONNA LET US
     OUT OF HERE OTHERWISE.

538
00:27:37,188 --> 00:27:39,124
     WE'RE GONNA NEED A GUN
          OR SOMETHING.

539
00:27:43,795 --> 00:27:46,164
       - IT'S STAN, RIGHT?

540
00:27:46,231 --> 00:27:48,366
         - YEAH. THANKS
        FOR REMEMBERING.

541
00:27:48,433 --> 00:27:49,868
             - YEAH.

542
00:27:49,934 --> 00:27:53,104
   UM, STAN, PARKER WANTED ME
      TO GET THAT ENVELOPE

543
00:27:53,171 --> 00:27:54,406
          THAT YOU PUT
         INTO EVIDENCE.

544
00:27:54,472 --> 00:27:55,640
             - SURE.

545
00:28:00,845 --> 00:28:02,147
         - I THINK THAT
       ALL OF THOSE YEARS

546
00:28:02,213 --> 00:28:04,416
         THAT YOU SPENT
      ABSORBING THAT ABUSE,

547
00:28:04,482 --> 00:28:06,451
     SWALLOWING THAT POISON,

548
00:28:06,518 --> 00:28:08,319
          I THINK TODAY
        WHEN HE SHOWED UP

549
00:28:08,386 --> 00:28:10,722
     IT FINALLY LEAKED OUT.

550
00:28:10,789 --> 00:28:13,425
       IT'S BEEN INFECTING
        ALL THESE PEOPLE.

551
00:28:14,392 --> 00:28:16,061
         LISTEN, IF YOU
       TELL ME WHO HE IS,

552
00:28:16,127 --> 00:28:18,396
      WE CAN CONFRONT HIM,

553
00:28:18,463 --> 00:28:19,998
          AND MAYBE WE
       CAN END THIS THING.

554
00:28:20,065 --> 00:28:22,467
            - HE'S--
       HE KNOWS I'M HERE.

555
00:28:22,534 --> 00:28:24,335
            HE KNOWS
       I'M TALKING TO YOU.

556
00:28:24,402 --> 00:28:28,339
  - NO. HOW WOULD HE KNOW THAT
         UNLESS HE'S...

557
00:28:28,406 --> 00:28:30,008
              HERE.

558
00:28:30,075 --> 00:28:32,310
            - [gasps]

559
00:28:32,377 --> 00:28:34,045
      - EXCUSE ME, OFFICER.

560
00:28:34,112 --> 00:28:36,247
         MIND IF I HAVE
      A WORD WITH MY WIFE?

561
00:28:44,856 --> 00:28:47,292
        - GET OVER THERE.
     - ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.

562
00:28:47,358 --> 00:28:49,961
     OKAY, YOU'RE IN CHARGE.

563
00:28:51,830 --> 00:28:54,365
          - YES, I AM.

564
00:29:00,705 --> 00:29:03,374
        I'VE HEARD ABOUT
      THE FREAKS IN HAVEN.

565
00:29:06,911 --> 00:29:10,315
   BUT CREATING A PESTILENCE?

566
00:29:10,381 --> 00:29:11,850
       - YOU DON'T HAVE TO
         DO THIS, HUGH.

567
00:29:11,916 --> 00:29:13,985
        - WELL, NOW I DO,
            DON'T I?

568
00:29:14,052 --> 00:29:16,454
           BECAUSE SHE
      COMPLAINED ABOUT ME.

569
00:29:16,521 --> 00:29:18,923
         - SHE DIDN'T DO
         ANYTHING WRONG.

570
00:29:18,990 --> 00:29:21,126
            - [sobs]

571
00:29:21,192 --> 00:29:23,795
          - SHE DID DO
        ONE THING RIGHT.

572
00:29:23,862 --> 00:29:26,397
     SHE GAVE EVERYONE ELSE
     THE DISEASE EXCEPT ME,

573
00:29:26,464 --> 00:29:28,600
             AND NOW
       THEY'RE ALL DYING.

574
00:29:28,666 --> 00:29:30,135
            MAYBE...

575
00:29:30,201 --> 00:29:32,670
        THAT'S BECAUSE...

576
00:29:32,737 --> 00:29:34,539
           YOU KNOW...

577
00:29:34,606 --> 00:29:38,443
      I'M THE ONLY ONE WHO
   TRULY UNDERSTANDS YOU, HUH?

578
00:29:40,645 --> 00:29:43,248
             - HEY.

579
00:29:43,314 --> 00:29:44,849
              HUGH.

580
00:29:44,916 --> 00:29:46,518
             BUDDY.

581
00:29:46,584 --> 00:29:48,486
     LET'S TALK ABOUT THIS.

582
00:29:48,553 --> 00:29:50,021
           - SIT DOWN.
   YOU'VE ALREADY DONE ENOUGH.

583
00:29:50,088 --> 00:29:52,557
  YOU ALREADY GAVE HIM MY GUN.
             - HEY!

584
00:29:52,624 --> 00:29:54,859
      DON'T YOU TALK TO HIM
           LIKE THAT.

585
00:29:58,496 --> 00:30:00,965
      MAYBE YOU NEED TO BE
    TAUGHT A LITTLE RESPECT.

586
00:30:01,032 --> 00:30:02,500
       WHAT DO YOU THINK?

587
00:30:05,670 --> 00:30:07,505
         WAIT A SECOND.

588
00:30:09,974 --> 00:30:12,877
    HOW COME YOU'RE NOT SICK
        LIKE THE OTHERS?

589
00:30:19,317 --> 00:30:22,420
       - NATHAN, COME ON.

590
00:30:22,487 --> 00:30:24,389
         YOU CAN'T JUST
        LOCK ME IN HERE.

591
00:30:24,455 --> 00:30:26,658
        I'M NOT--I'M NOT
       GONNA DO ANYTHING.

592
00:30:26,724 --> 00:30:28,393
  - YOU'RE NOT THINKING RIGHT.

593
00:30:28,459 --> 00:30:31,262
     - NATHAN, I GOT BACKUP.
 THE SHERIFF'S TEN MINUTES OUT.

594
00:30:31,329 --> 00:30:32,630
            - GREAT.
          - NOT GREAT.

595
00:30:32,697 --> 00:30:33,965
      OUR BUDDIES OUT HERE
       MUST HAVE A SCANNER

596
00:30:34,032 --> 00:30:35,466
            AND HEARD
        THE CALL GO OUT.

597
00:30:35,533 --> 00:30:37,168
       THEY'RE GEARING UP.
  LOOKS LIKE THEY'RE COMING IN.

598
00:30:37,235 --> 00:30:39,103
    - THEY WANNA WIPE US OUT
     BEFORE HELP GETS HERE.

599
00:30:39,170 --> 00:30:41,306
  - THEY'RE COMING IN THE BACK.
      I'VE GOT YOU COVERED.

600
00:30:44,342 --> 00:30:46,611
            - NATHAN.

601
00:30:46,678 --> 00:30:48,213
       YOU GOTTA LET ME GO
            WITH YOU.

602
00:30:48,279 --> 00:30:50,882
      - I'M NOT LETTING YOU
      GET YOURSELF KILLED.

603
00:30:50,949 --> 00:30:52,650
            - NATHAN!

604
00:30:52,717 --> 00:30:54,652
              WAIT!

605
00:30:54,719 --> 00:30:57,388
             NATHAN,
      DON'T DO THIS TO ME!

606
00:31:03,661 --> 00:31:07,966
          - I'M SORRY.
      I CAN'T LET YOU LIVE.

607
00:31:08,032 --> 00:31:10,335
       YOU'LL KEEP ME AWAY
         FROM MY NICOLE.

608
00:31:10,401 --> 00:31:13,071
      - HEY, COME ON, DOC.

609
00:31:13,137 --> 00:31:15,073
           I GET YOU.

610
00:31:15,139 --> 00:31:18,243
        I UNDERSTAND WHY
       YOU'RE DOING THIS.

611
00:31:18,309 --> 00:31:19,611
        SOMETIMES IT'S...

612
00:31:19,677 --> 00:31:21,512
      - ISOLATING YOURSELF,

613
00:31:21,579 --> 00:31:23,314
          FEELING WEAK,
    THAT'S WHAT CAUSED THIS.

614
00:31:23,381 --> 00:31:24,749
          BUT WHAT YOU
     HAVE INSIDE OF YOU NOW,

615
00:31:24,816 --> 00:31:26,184
            YOU NEED
       TO TURN IT AROUND.

616
00:31:26,251 --> 00:31:29,487
       FIGHT BACK, NIKKI.
           - I CAN'T.

617
00:31:29,554 --> 00:31:32,390
        - YOU DON'T WANNA
       SEE ME DIE, DO YA?

618
00:31:34,158 --> 00:31:35,593
      - LISTEN, YOU'RE NOT
     JUST HURTING YOURSELF.

619
00:31:35,660 --> 00:31:37,428
     YOU'RE HURTING EVERYONE
        ELSE HERE, OKAY?

620
00:31:37,495 --> 00:31:38,696
            - [sighs]

621
00:31:38,763 --> 00:31:40,798
       - FIND THE STRENGTH
         AND FIGHT BACK.

622
00:31:40,865 --> 00:31:43,735
          - ALL RIGHT,
    THAT'S ENOUGH OUT OF YOU!

623
00:31:45,670 --> 00:31:49,307
        - STOP IT, HUGH!

624
00:31:49,374 --> 00:31:51,709
            NO MORE.

625
00:31:55,914 --> 00:31:59,651
       - WHAT DID YOU SAY?
         - YOU HEARD ME.

626
00:31:59,717 --> 00:32:01,719
         [sighs deeply]

627
00:32:01,786 --> 00:32:03,788
        - NOW, I'M GONNA
         COUNT TO THREE,

628
00:32:03,855 --> 00:32:06,324
        AND YOU ARE GONNA
        GET ON YOUR KNEES

629
00:32:06,391 --> 00:32:08,226
         AND APOLOGIZE.

630
00:32:08,293 --> 00:32:10,361
              - NO.

631
00:32:11,429 --> 00:32:13,731
      YOU HAVE POISONED ME
         WITH YOUR ABUSE

632
00:32:13,798 --> 00:32:15,733
           FOR YEARS.

633
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:17,735
            I'M DONE.

634
00:32:17,802 --> 00:32:20,138
           SO KILL ME
          IF YOU WANT.

635
00:32:20,204 --> 00:32:22,307
        BUT I DON'T THINK
            YOU WILL,

636
00:32:22,373 --> 00:32:24,876
     BECAUSE YOU'RE NOTHING
          BUT A COWARD.

637
00:32:26,778 --> 00:32:28,846
          ROT IN HELL.

638
00:32:30,381 --> 00:32:32,550
          - [groaning]

639
00:32:36,554 --> 00:32:40,692
            [gasping]

640
00:32:41,893 --> 00:32:44,862
      - [breathes heavily]

641
00:32:47,966 --> 00:32:49,367
              I...

642
00:32:49,434 --> 00:32:52,236
          I--I DID THAT
             TO HIM.

643
00:32:52,303 --> 00:32:54,205
        I--I KILLED HIM.
              - NO.

644
00:32:54,272 --> 00:32:56,274
      LISTEN, YOU SAVED US.

645
00:33:01,079 --> 00:33:02,914
         HEY, IT'S OVER.

646
00:33:04,048 --> 00:33:06,184
      - NOT FOR THOSE GUYS
            OUTSIDE.

647
00:33:06,250 --> 00:33:07,919
       THEY'RE COMING IN.
             - WHY?

648
00:33:07,986 --> 00:33:10,521
      - WIPE OUT THE CURSE
       AND EVERYONE ELSE.

649
00:33:12,023 --> 00:33:14,359
             - OKAY.

650
00:33:14,425 --> 00:33:17,261
       WELL, GO STOP 'EM.
      I'LL CALL FOR BACKUP.

651
00:33:23,835 --> 00:33:26,371
     - DWIGHT, DO YOU COPY?

652
00:33:27,438 --> 00:33:29,207
           [gun cocks]

653
00:33:29,273 --> 00:33:31,576
        - THEY'RE COMING.
            GET BACK.

654
00:33:31,642 --> 00:33:35,747
            [gunfire]

655
00:33:36,781 --> 00:33:40,218
         [siren wailing]

656
00:33:40,284 --> 00:33:41,753
    - LET'S GET OUT OF HERE!

657
00:33:41,819 --> 00:33:44,722
      [car door slams shut,
         tires screech]

658
00:33:44,789 --> 00:33:48,092
         [siren wailing]

659
00:33:55,867 --> 00:33:57,402
      - [breathes heavily]

660
00:33:57,468 --> 00:34:00,705
     - DWIGHT, YOU'RE SHOT.

661
00:34:03,508 --> 00:34:05,309
      - ONE GRAZED MY NECK.

662
00:34:05,376 --> 00:34:06,744
         LET ME GUESS--

663
00:34:06,811 --> 00:34:09,380
        YOU DIDN'T CATCH
        A SINGLE BULLET.

664
00:34:09,447 --> 00:34:11,449
    - NOTHING HIT THE WALLS.

665
00:34:11,516 --> 00:34:13,284
          I'M NOT HIT.
         I DON'T GET IT.

666
00:34:17,055 --> 00:34:21,325
        - BULLETS--THEY,
      UH, TEND TO FIND ME.

667
00:34:23,428 --> 00:34:24,862
       IT'S A LONG STORY.

668
00:34:24,929 --> 00:34:27,999
         - BULLETS TEND
          TO FIND YOU?

669
00:34:30,935 --> 00:34:34,405
      THAT'S YOUR TROUBLE?

670
00:34:37,442 --> 00:34:39,377
      WELL, YOU WERE RIGHT.

671
00:34:39,444 --> 00:34:40,711
    THE WAY THINGS ARE GOING,

672
00:34:40,778 --> 00:34:43,815
     I MIGHT NEED YOU AROUND
         MORE THAN EVER.

673
00:35:19,617 --> 00:35:23,187
   - I'M SORRY FOR YOUR LOSS,
          MR. CROCKER.

674
00:35:23,254 --> 00:35:26,357
           I TRULY AM.

675
00:35:26,424 --> 00:35:29,627
   - SHE DIDN'T KNOW ANYTHING
        ABOUT THIS TOWN.

676
00:35:32,630 --> 00:35:35,366
        - SHE WAS ONE OF
    THE MANY INNOCENT VICTIMS

677
00:35:35,433 --> 00:35:37,101
        OF THE TROUBLED.

678
00:35:38,636 --> 00:35:41,139
         I LOST MY WIFE
          TO THEM TOO.

679
00:35:47,845 --> 00:35:51,282
      - I DON'T UNDERSTAND
          ANY OF THIS.

680
00:35:54,318 --> 00:35:57,021
        - I CAN HELP YOU,
          MR. CROCKER.

681
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:03,694
      BUT YOU'RE GONNA HAVE
         TO PROVE TO ME

682
00:36:03,761 --> 00:36:05,029
       THAT YOU'RE WORTHY.

683
00:36:12,904 --> 00:36:14,305
           - REVEREND.

684
00:36:22,513 --> 00:36:24,882
           THANK YOU.

685
00:36:27,285 --> 00:36:29,453
      - I'LL PRAY FOR HER.

686
00:36:45,736 --> 00:36:48,806
      - DWIGHT, I NEED YOU
     TO DO SOMETHING FOR ME.

687
00:36:48,873 --> 00:36:50,975
        EVI RYAN--MAKE IT
       LOOK LIKE A SUICIDE

688
00:36:51,042 --> 00:36:52,310
         OR AN ACCIDENT,

689
00:36:52,376 --> 00:36:54,378
         JUST AS LONG AS
       THE CASE IS CLOSED.

690
00:36:54,445 --> 00:36:56,314
       - WE'RE NOT TALKING
        ABOUT COVERING UP

691
00:36:56,380 --> 00:36:58,082
      A SUPERNATURAL EVENT.

692
00:36:58,149 --> 00:36:59,584
        THIS IS A MURDER.

693
00:36:59,650 --> 00:37:00,952
   - WE CAN'T INVESTIGATE THIS
      WITH THE STATE POLICE

694
00:37:01,018 --> 00:37:02,119
   LOOKING OVER OUR SHOULDER.

695
00:37:02,186 --> 00:37:03,988
         - EVI WAS SHOT
          IN THE CHEST.

696
00:37:04,055 --> 00:37:05,790
       SHE HAS BLACK VEINS
          IN HER ARMS.

697
00:37:05,856 --> 00:37:08,326
 THE MEDICAL EXAMINER'S NEVER--
          - NO PROBLEM.

698
00:37:09,927 --> 00:37:12,430
 WOULDN'T BE THE TOUGHEST THING
        I EVER HAD TO DO.

699
00:37:13,731 --> 00:37:17,768
          IF IT'S OKAY
        WITH YOU, CHIEF.

700
00:37:21,372 --> 00:37:23,474
            - DO IT.

701
00:37:23,541 --> 00:37:24,742
        ONE MORE THING--

702
00:37:24,809 --> 00:37:27,378
     WE GOT CHIEF MERRILL'S
        CELL PHONE LOGS.

703
00:37:27,445 --> 00:37:28,779
       GUESS WHO HE TALKED
      TO HALF A DOZEN TIMES

704
00:37:28,846 --> 00:37:30,147
      DURING THE LOCKDOWN?

705
00:37:30,214 --> 00:37:31,415
           - THE REV.

706
00:37:36,754 --> 00:37:38,756
       HE'S IN THE MIDDLE
         OF ALL OF THIS.

707
00:38:16,260 --> 00:38:19,196
     SORRY. I GOT CAUGHT UP
         AT WORK, SO...

708
00:38:19,263 --> 00:38:22,366
    - LET ME GO FIRST, OKAY?

709
00:38:22,433 --> 00:38:23,668
             [sighs]

710
00:38:23,734 --> 00:38:27,271
          I SCREWED UP.
             HUGELY.

711
00:38:28,406 --> 00:38:33,311
       AND GIVING YOUR GUN
       TO A PSYCHOPATH...

712
00:38:33,377 --> 00:38:36,213
       THAT MAY HAVE BEEN
    THE LEAST OF MY MISTAKES.

713
00:38:37,948 --> 00:38:40,117
       I LOST YOUR TRUST.

714
00:38:42,987 --> 00:38:45,289
    I THOUGHT I COULD HANDLE
         MY AFFLICTION.

715
00:38:45,356 --> 00:38:47,725
         - CHRIS, YOU--
         - LAST NIGHT...

716
00:38:47,792 --> 00:38:50,561
        I GAVE INTO IT...

717
00:38:50,628 --> 00:38:52,963
           AND NEARLY
       GOT PEOPLE KILLED.

718
00:38:54,465 --> 00:38:56,734
         AND THAT THING
       I SAID TO YOU ABOUT

719
00:38:56,801 --> 00:38:59,570
           WISHING YOU
        WEREN'T IMMUNE...

720
00:38:59,637 --> 00:39:01,105
        THAT'S NOT TRUE.

721
00:39:02,807 --> 00:39:04,508
  I WANNA BE WITH YOU, AUDREY.

722
00:39:04,575 --> 00:39:07,978
     I NEED TO BE WITH YOU.

723
00:39:12,717 --> 00:39:15,119
       - YOU ONCE TOLD ME,

724
00:39:15,186 --> 00:39:19,557
           "I WANT YOU
      BECAUSE YOU'RE YOU."

725
00:39:21,992 --> 00:39:25,863
   WANTING ME AND NEEDING ME,
  THEY'RE TWO DIFFERENT THINGS.

726
00:39:28,199 --> 00:39:31,869
      I CAN'T BE THE PERSON
       THAT KEEPS YOU YOU.

727
00:39:36,140 --> 00:39:38,976
        YOU GOTTA DO THAT
          ON YOUR OWN.

728
00:39:39,043 --> 00:39:40,978
             - YEAH.

729
00:39:42,847 --> 00:39:44,348
       - IT'S JUST YOU'D--

730
00:39:44,415 --> 00:39:47,385
     YOU'D EVENTUALLY START
      RESENTING ME FOR IT.

731
00:39:49,887 --> 00:39:51,322
    - I THINK THE BEST THING
          FOR ME TO DO

732
00:39:51,389 --> 00:39:53,991
         IS TO JUST...GO

733
00:39:54,058 --> 00:39:56,494
      SOMEWHERE BY MYSELF,
     AWAY FROM OTHER PEOPLE.

734
00:39:56,560 --> 00:39:58,162
     - NO, CHRIS, THAT'S NOT
        WHAT I'M SAYING.

735
00:39:58,229 --> 00:40:00,464
       - YOU KNOW, SOMEDAY
   THE TROUBLES ARE GONNA END,

736
00:40:00,531 --> 00:40:02,133
      AND I'M GONNA GO BACK
        TO BEING THE GUY

737
00:40:02,199 --> 00:40:04,635
      THAT EVERYBODY HATES.

738
00:40:08,305 --> 00:40:11,776
    MAYBE THEN I'LL BE A GUY
       THAT YOU CAN LOVE.

